                                "sense_id": "97d9705f-c653-3105-a53b-c8c6867c74a1",
                                "text": "This is always the way in India: the servant assures you that what you require is not procurable […] you politely reply, \"Jow\" (go away), and in nine cases out of ten he will return with the desired article; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ebc1cbdb-3b06-48f4-ba67-256c312c5d03",
                                "sense_id": "97d9705f-c653-3105-a53b-c8c6867c74a1",
                                "text": "He angrily tells the crowd to jow (go away), and the nearest of them sheer off a few paces, […]"
                            }
                        ]
